step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Sanfew</col> (top floor of the Taverley herblore store) , or if you have completed <col=800000>Zogre Flesh Eaters</col>).</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Sanfew (top floor of the Taverley herblore store) , or if you have completed Zogre Flesh Eaters).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Climb to the top of Trollheim, using the agility shortcuts if you can to save time, and enter Eadgar's Cave (see map for path alternatives).</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Sanfew (top floor of the Taverley herblore store) , or if you have completed Zogre Flesh Eaters).</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb to the top of Trollheim, using the agility shortcuts if you can to save time, and enter Eadgar's Cave (see map for path alternatives).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>If you have not yet freed <col=800000>Eadgar</col> in the troll stronghold's prison, pickpocket (30+ Thieving) or kill <col=800000>Berry</col> the northern sleeping troll guard and use the <col=800000>cell key 2</col> on Eadgar's cell. Check your Troll Stronghold quest log and there will be a line that will either say "I've rescued Godric" or "I've rescued Godric and Mad Eadgar" to make sure.</col>
